	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d12_visitor05_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンを　あくじに　つかうひとが
おおすぎるのよ……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T11:54:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンを　悪事に　使う人が
多すぎるのよ……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
